                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Consider a snippet of golang code:\r\n\r\n```go\r\nif DEBUG{\r\n   log.Println(\"Message\")\r\n   time.Sleep(time.Second) // <- cursor is on this line\r\n}\r\n```\r\nis there functionality in mini.surround to remove the `if` statement and curlies, but keep the inner code? How to do that in the most reliable and easy way?\r\n\r\nEDIT: I am aware of `sd{`, but the `if` statement from the example doesnt get deleted this way.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Consider a snippet of golang code:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-go notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"if DEBUG{\n   log.Println(&quot;Message&quot;)\n   time.Sleep(time.Second) // &lt;- cursor is on this line\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">DEBUG</span>{\n   <span class=\"pl-s1\">log</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Println</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"Message\"</span>)\n   <span class=\"pl-s1\">time</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Sleep</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">time</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">Second</span>) <span class=\"pl-c\">// &lt;- cursor is on this line</span>\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">is there functionality in mini.surround to remove the <code class=\"notranslate\">if</code> statement and curlies, but keep the inner code? How to do that in the most reliable and easy way?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">EDIT: I am aware of <code class=\"notranslate\">sd{</code>, but the <code class=\"notranslate\">if</code> statement from the example doesnt get deleted this way.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Consider a snippet of golang code:\nif DEBUG{\n   log.Println(\"Message\")\n   time.Sleep(time.Second) // <- cursor is on this line\n}\nis there functionality in mini.surround to remove the if statement and curlies, but keep the inner code? How to do that in the most reliable and easy way?\nEDIT: I am aware of sd{, but the if statement from the example doesnt get deleted this way.",
